  "warnings": [
    "grp013 contains two off-screen crossings of the 6.8 m hall that the shot list does not give her time to walk on screen (sh033 ends in the middle of the hall, sh034 opens at the west door line; sh034 ends at the west doors, sh035 opens at an east-wall handle). Each is staged as a 0.001 s step exactly at the cut instant so the camera view is clean; only the top-down/spatial view shows the jump. Both are ordinary cut ellipses, not walk paths.",
    "sh034's camera runs abeam at 3.125 m from the west door line at 1.0 m/s, screen-right opening toward +X, her travel direction. camera.json quotes 0.55 m/s and 'three to four door bays'; at 3.31 m door spacing that is one bay, and her three handle beats at t=0.8/2.6/4.4 need about 1.1 m/s, so her pace and the rig's are set from the door geometry.",
    "sh033's dolly runs behind her down the long axis at her own 0.36 m/s rather than camera.json's quoted 0.8 m/s / 6 m, because the blocking only gives her 2.9 m of walk in the 8 s; the rig holds a constant 4.15 m standoff so her frame size holds.",
    "No camera stands inside a wall: sh033 at X -13.05 (north end wall face is X -15.99), sh034/sh035 at Z 0.275/1.85 in the open hall."
